{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p050a","title":"诸将专权辱官擅授校尉卖官御史刻印不供","accounts":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p050a-account","label":"《魏书》","text":"诸将专权辱官擅授校尉卖官御史刻印不供","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p050a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"label":"献帝居河东时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["dongyuan-e-p050a-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-p050a-q","source_order":[6,181,"P050a"],"order":1595}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-p050a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-2d618e560f7a06b8f7b7","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝四﹞《魏书》曰：“乘舆时居棘篱中，门户无关闭。天子与群臣会，兵士伏篱上观，互相镇压以为笑。诸将专权，或擅笞杀尚书。司隶校尉出入，民、兵抵掷之。诸将或遣婢，诣省閤；或自赍酒啖，过天子饮。侍中不通，喧呼骂詈，遂不能止。又竞表拜诸营壁民为部曲，求其礼遗。医师、走卒，皆为校尉；御史刻印不供，乃以锥画，示有文字：或不时得也。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8c0f624ab956f4bfa628","start":0,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
